+guidance+in+this+subclause+relates+to+the+risks+of+prioritized+activities+being+disrupted.+Guidance+relating+to+the+effectiveness+of+the+BCMS+is+provided+in+6.1.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3EThe+purpose+of+the+risk+assessment+is+to+enable+the+organization+to+assess+the+risks+of+prioritized+activities+being+disrupted+so+that+it+can+take+appropriate+action+to+address+these+risks.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3EThe+organization+should+implement+and+maintain+a+formal+risk+assessment+process+that+systematically+identifies%2C+analyses+and+evaluates+the+risk+of+disrupting+the+organization%26rsquo%3Bs+prioritized+activities+and+the+processes%2C+systems%2C+information%2C+people%2C+assets%2C+suppliers+and+other+resources+that+support+them.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3ERisk+assessment+is+a+structured+process+for+analysing+risk+in+terms+of+likelihood+and+consequences+before+deciding+on+further+treatment+that+could+be+required.+This+structured+process+attempts+to+answer+some+fundamental+questions%2C+such+as+the+following%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26mdash%3B+What+could+happen%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26mdash%3B+What+is+the+likelihood+of+it+or+them+happening%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26mdash%3B+What+could+be+the+consequences%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26mdash%3B+Is+there+anything+that+could+mitigate+the+consequences+or+reduce+the+likelihood%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3EThe+process+should+take+into+consideration+the+context+of+the+organization+and+the+needs+and+expectations+of+interested+parties+%28see+4.1+and+4.2%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26mdash%3B+resources+required+by+activities+identified+as+high+priority%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26mdash%3B+where+the+replacement+lead+time+for+the+resource+is+longer+than+the+activity%26rsquo%3Bs+recovery+time+objective.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3EThe+organization+should+select+an+appropriate+method+for+identifying%2C+analysing+and+evaluating+risks+that+could+lead+to+a+disruption.+ISO+31000+sets+out+the+principles+of+risk+management+and+associated+guidelines.+Typical+elements+that+should+be+included+in+the+context+of+this+document+are+as+follows.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3Ea%29+Identification+of+risks%3A+Potential+sources+of+risk+to+the+organization%26rsquo%3Bs+prioritized+activities+and+the+processes%2C+systems%2C+data%2C+people%2C+assets%2C+suppliers+and+other+resources+that+support+them.+These+can+come+from%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B1%29+specific+threats+that+could+at+some+point+disrupt+activities+and+resources+%28e.g.+fire%2C+flood%2C+power+failure%2C+staff+loss%2C+staff%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+absenteeism%2C+computer+viruses%2C+hardware+failure%29%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B2%29+disruptions%2C+which+could+arise+from+vulnerabilities+within+resources+%28e.g.+single+points+of+failure%2C+inadequacies+in+fire+protection%2C%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3Black+of+electrical+resilience%2C+inadequate+staffing+levels%2C+poor+IT+security+and+resilience%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3Eb%29+Analysis+of+risks%3A+An+understanding+of+the+risk+so+that+it+can+be+evaluated+and+the+most+appropriate+treatment+can+be+determined.+This+should+involve%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B1%29+considering+the+causes+and+sources+of+risk%2C+the+likelihood+of+both+positive+and+negative+consequences%2C+and+the+effect+that+other+factors+could+have+on+the+likelihood%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B2%29+determining+the+risks%2C+based+primarily+on+their+likelihood+and+anticipated+consequences%2C+but+also+taking+into+account+the+effectiveness+and+efficiency+of+existing+controls.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3EA+key+parameter+in+the+analysis+is+likelihood%2C+so+confidence+in+its+validity+%28based+on+divergence+of+opinion+among+experts%2C+uncertainty%2C+availability%2C+quality%2C+quantity+and+ongoing+relevance+of+information%2C+or+limitations+on+modelling%29+should+be+considered+and+brought+to+the+attention+of+decision+makers+and+other+interested+parties.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3EThe+analysis+can+be+qualitative%2C+semi-quantitative+or+quantitative.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3Ec%29+Evaluation+of+risks%3A+An+evaluation+of+which+disruption-related+risks+require+treatment.+This+should+focus+on+the+resources+required+by+activities+with+high+priority+or+with+significant+replacement+lead+time.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%3Cp%3EThe+organization+should+be+aware+of+any+financial%2C+regulatory%2Flegislative+or+governmental+obligations+requiring+the+communication+of+these+findings.+In+addition%2C+certain+societal+needs+can+also+warrant+sharing+of+this+information+at+an+appropriate+level+of+detail.%3C%2Fp%3E\";previous_page|s:30:\"https://sentral.dutastudy.com/\";app_session|O:8:\"stdClass\":19:{s:7:\"id_user\";s:2:\"73\";s:11:\"employee_id\";N;s:8:\"username\";s:5:\"Angga\";s:8:\"password\";s:60:\"$2y$11$Jgo/lLBd/4QJ/zptmnmhDeq1F/wxzD0qcGs301gklur5xNapkkUka\";s:5:\"email\";s:15:\"angga@gmail.com\";s:9:\"full_name\";s:5:\"Angga\";s:7:\"address\";s:9:\"fdsfasfds\";s:4:\"city\";s:7:\"Jakarta\";s:5:\"phone\";s:8:\"00000000\";s:2:\"ip\";s:15:\"125.166.215.189\";s:5:\"photo\";N;s:10:\"created_by\";s:1:\"4\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2023-08-14 16:42:03\";s:11:\"modified_at\";s:19:\"2023-08-16 11:01:24\";s:11:\"modified_by\";s:1:\"2\";s:10:\"deleted_at\";N;s:10:\"deleted_by\";s:1:\"0\";s:10:\"last_login\";s:19:\"2024-01-10 10:27:51\";s:6:\"status\";s:3:\"ACT\";}company|O:8:\"stdClass\":15:{s:13:\"id_perusahaan\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"inisial\";s:3:\"ssc\";s:13:\"nm_perusahaan\";s:25:\"Sentral Sistem Consulting\";s:6:\"alamat\";s:154:\"M.T. Haryono KAV.10, MTH Square Lt.3A No.2, Cawang, RT.6/RW.12, Bidara Cina, Kecamatan Jatinegara, Kota Jakarta Timur, Daerah Khusus Ibukota Jakarta 13330\";s:4:\"kota\";N;s:7:\"no_telp\";N;s:3:\"fax\";N;s:5:\"email\";N;s:7:\"website\";N;s:4:\"logo\";N;s:6:\"gambar\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2021-08-02 11:25:07\";s:11:\"modified_at\";s:19:\"2021-08-02 11:28:50\";s:10:\"created_by\";s:2:\"54\";s:11:\"modified_by\";s:2:\"54\";}group|O:8:\"stdClass\":6:{s:8:\"i